{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"太阳病下 - 分类","description":"这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。","home_page_url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://acuherb.xyz/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://acuherb.xyz/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.webp"}],"items":[{"title":"辨太阳病脉证并治法下：一九三","date_published":"2025-06-12T19:36:22&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-09-22T11:58:50Z","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/shanghanlun-193/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/shanghanlun-193/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.webp"}],"summary":"一九三：脉，按之来缓，而时一止复来者，名曰「结」，阴也。又脉来数，而中止更来，及小数中止能自还者，名曰「促」，阳也。脉来缓，而中止不能自还，因而复动者，名曰「代」，「阴」也；得此脉者，必难治。 ","content_html":"\u003ch2 class=\"heading-element\" id=\"一九三脉按之来缓而时一止复来者名曰结阴也又脉来数而中止更来及小数中止能自还者名曰促阳也脉来缓而中止不能自还因而复动者名曰代阴也得此脉者必难治\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e一九三：脉，按之来缓，而时一止复来者，名曰「结」，阴也。又脉来数，而中止更来，及小数中止能自还者，名曰「促」，阳也。脉来缓，而中止不能自还，因而复动者，名曰「代」，「阴」也；得此脉者，必难治。\u003c/span\u003e\n  \u003ca href=\"#%e4%b8%80%e4%b9%9d%e4%b8%89%e8%84%89%e6%8c%89%e4%b9%8b%e6%9d%a5%e7%bc%93%e8%80%8c%e6%97%b6%e4%b8%80%e6%ad%a2%e5%a4%8d%e6%9d%a5%e8%80%85%e5%90%8d%e6%9b%b0%e7%bb%93%e9%98%b4%e4%b9%9f%e5%8f%88%e8%84%89%e6%9d%a5%e6%95%b0%e8%80%8c%e4%b8%ad%e6%ad%a2%e6%9b%b4%e6%9d%a5%e5%8f%8a%e5%b0%8f%e6%95%b0%e4%b8%ad%e6%ad%a2%e8%83%bd%e8%87%aa%e8%bf%98%e8%80%85%e5%90%8d%e6%9b%b0%e4%bf%83%e9%98%b3%e4%b9%9f%e8%84%89%e6%9d%a5%e7%bc%93%e8%80%8c%e4%b8%ad%e6%ad%a2%e4%b8%8d%e8%83%bd%e8%87%aa%e8%bf%98%e5%9b%a0%e8%80%8c%e5%a4%8d%e5%8a%a8%e8%80%85%e5%90%8d%e6%9b%b0%e4%bb%a3%e9%98%b4%e4%b9%9f%e5%be%97%e6%ad%a4%e8%84%89%e8%80%85%e5%bf%85%e9%9a%be%e6%b2%bb\" class=\"heading-mark\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 